`,o.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Business Directory versions up to and including 6.4.27 contain an insecure direct object reference in the listing image management flow. The vulnerable AJAX handler checks whether the current user can edit the selected directory listing, but it does not verify that the user is authorized to manage each attachment supplied through the ",o.jsx(t.code,{children:"image_ids"})," parameter."]}),`
